sign/vectors/composite/id-MLDSA65-Ed25519-SHA512.json holds the test vectors of draft-ietf-lamps-pq-composite-sigs-19,
Appendix E, as the IETF published that draft
(https://www.ietf.org/archive/id/draft-ietf-lamps-pq-composite-sigs-19.txt); the file names its source, that address
and the sha256 of the text it was taken from. core/vectors/jcs/objects.json includes the two examples of RFC 8785,
sections 3.2.2 and 3.2.3 (https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc8785). Each of these is under the terms its document
states.
